{"id":"harmonium","title":"Harmonium","author":"Wallace Stevens","year":"1923","note":"Stevens’s debut: Florida light, blackbirds, and the mind inventing order against chaos.","minutes":293,"cover":"","coverAlt":"","scenes":[{"id":"s0","title":"Chapter 1","place":"Chapter 1","reentry":"Earthy Anecdote","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"}],"breaths":[{"id":"s0-0","sceneId":"s0","text":"Earthy Anecdote"},{"id":"s0-1","sceneId":"s0","text":"Every time the bucks went clattering"},{"id":"s0-2","sceneId":"s0","text":"Over Oklahoma"},{"id":"s0-3","sceneId":"s0","text":"A firecat bristled in the way."},{"id":"s0-4","sceneId":"s0","text":"Wherever they went,"},{"id":"s0-5","sceneId":"s0","text":"They went clattering,"},{"id":"s0-6","sceneId":"s0","text":"Until they swerved"},{"id":"s0-7","sceneId":"s0","text":"In a swift, circular line"},{"id":"s0-8","sceneId":"s0","text":"To the right,"},{"id":"s0-9","sceneId":"s0","text":"Because of the firecat."},{"id":"s0-10","sceneId":"s0","text":"Or until they swerved"},{"id":"s0-11","sceneId":"s0","text":"In a swift, circular line"},{"id":"s0-12","sceneId":"s0","text":"To the left,"},{"id":"s0-13","sceneId":"s0","text":"Because of the firecat."},{"id":"s0-14","sceneId":"s0","text":"The bucks clattered."},{"id":"s0-15","sceneId":"s0","text":"The firecat went leaping,"},{"id":"s0-16","sceneId":"s0","text":"To the right, to the left,"},{"id":"s0-17","sceneId":"s0","text":"And"},{"id":"s0-18","sceneId":"s0","text":"Bristled in the way."},{"id":"s0-19","sceneId":"s0","text":"Later, the firecat closed his bright eyes"},{"id":"s0-20","sceneId":"s0","text":"And slept."},{"id":"s0-21","sceneId":"s0","text":"Invective against Swans"},{"id":"s0-22","sceneId":"s0","text":"The soul, O ganders, flies beyond the parks"},{"id":"s0-23","sceneId":"s0","text":"And far beyond the discords of the wind."},{"id":"s0-24","sceneId":"s0","text":"A bronze rain from the sun descending marks"},{"id":"s0-25","sceneId":"s0","text":"The death of summer, which that time endures"},{"id":"s0-26","sceneId":"s0","text":"Like one who scrawls a listless testament"},{"id":"s0-27","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of golden quirks and Paphian caricatures,"},{"id":"s0-28","sceneId":"s0","text":"Bequeathing your white feathers to the moon"},{"id":"s0-29","sceneId":"s0","text":"And giving your bland motions to the air."},{"id":"s0-30","sceneId":"s0","text":"Behold, already on the long parades"},{"id":"s0-31","sceneId":"s0","text":"The crows anoint the statues with their dirt."},{"id":"s0-32","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the soul, O ganders, being lonely, flies"},{"id":"s0-33","sceneId":"s0","text":"Beyond your chilly chariots, to the skies."},{"id":"s0-34","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the Carolinas"},{"id":"s0-35","sceneId":"s0","text":"The lilacs wither in the Carolinas."},{"id":"s0-36","sceneId":"s0","text":"Already the butterflies flutter above the cabins."},{"id":"s0-37","sceneId":"s0","text":"Already the new-born children interpret love"},{"id":"s0-38","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the voices of mothers."},{"id":"s0-39","sceneId":"s0","text":"Timeless mother,"},{"id":"s0-40","sceneId":"s0","text":"How is it that your aspic nipples"},{"id":"s0-41","sceneId":"s0","text":"For once vent honey?"},{"id":"s0-42","sceneId":"s0","text":"_The pine-tree sweetens my body."},{"id":"s0-43","sceneId":"s0","text":"The white iris beautifies me._"},{"id":"s0-44","sceneId":"s0","text":"The Paltry Nude Starts on a Spring Voyage"},{"id":"s0-45","sceneId":"s0","text":"But not on a shell, she starts,"},{"id":"s0-46","sceneId":"s0","text":"Archaic, for the sea."},{"id":"s0-47","sceneId":"s0","text":"But on the first-found weed"},{"id":"s0-48","sceneId":"s0","text":"She scuds the glitters,"},{"id":"s0-49","sceneId":"s0","text":"Noiselessly, like one more wave."},{"id":"s0-50","sceneId":"s0","text":"She too is discontent"},{"id":"s0-51","sceneId":"s0","text":"And would have purple stuff upon her arms,"},{"id":"s0-52","sceneId":"s0","text":"Tired of the salty harbors,"},{"id":"s0-53","sceneId":"s0","text":"Eager for the brine and bellowing"},{"id":"s0-54","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of the high interiors of the sea."},{"id":"s0-55","sceneId":"s0","text":"The wind speeds her,"},{"id":"s0-56","sceneId":"s0","text":"Blowing upon her hands"},{"id":"s0-57","sceneId":"s0","text":"And watery back."},{"id":"s0-58","sceneId":"s0","text":"She touches the clouds, where she goes"},{"id":"s0-59","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the circle of her traverse of the sea."},{"id":"s0-60","sceneId":"s0","text":"Yet this is meagre play"},{"id":"s0-61","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the scurry and water-shine,"},{"id":"s0-62","sceneId":"s0","text":"As her heels foam--"},{"id":"s0-63","sceneId":"s0","text":"Not as when the goldener nude"},{"id":"s0-64","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of a later day"},{"id":"s0-65","sceneId":"s0","text":"Will go, like the centre of sea-green pomp,"},{"id":"s0-66","sceneId":"s0","text":"In an intenser calm,"},{"id":"s0-67","sceneId":"s0","text":"Scullion of fate,"},{"id":"s0-68","sceneId":"s0","text":"Across the spick torrent, ceaselessly,"},{"id":"s0-69","sceneId":"s0","text":"Upon her irretrievable way."},{"id":"s0-70","sceneId":"s0","text":"The Plot against the Giant"},{"id":"s0-71","sceneId":"s0","text":"_First Girl_"},{"id":"s0-72","sceneId":"s0","text":"When this yokel comes maundering,"},{"id":"s0-73","sceneId":"s0","text":"Whetting his hacker,"},{"id":"s0-74","sceneId":"s0","text":"I shall run before him,"},{"id":"s0-75","sceneId":"s0","text":"Diffusing the civilest odors"},{"id":"s0-76","sceneId":"s0","text":"Out of geraniums and unsmelled flowers."},{"id":"s0-77","sceneId":"s0","text":"It will check him."},{"id":"s0-78","sceneId":"s0","text":"_Second Girl_"},{"id":"s0-79","sceneId":"s0","text":"I shall run before him,"},{"id":"s0-80","sceneId":"s0","text":"Arching cloths besprinkled with colors"},{"id":"s0-81","sceneId":"s0","text":"As small as fish-eggs."},{"id":"s0-82","sceneId":"s0","text":"The threads"},{"id":"s0-83","sceneId":"s0","text":"Will abash him."},{"id":"s0-84","sceneId":"s0","text":"_Third Girl_"},{"id":"s0-85","sceneId":"s0","text":"Oh, la ... le pauvre!"},{"id":"s0-86","sceneId":"s0","text":"I shall run before him,"},{"id":"s0-87","sceneId":"s0","text":"With a curious puffing."},{"id":"s0-88","sceneId":"s0","text":"He will bend his ear then."},{"id":"s0-89","sceneId":"s0","text":"I shall whisper"},{"id":"s0-90","sceneId":"s0","text":"Heavenly labials in a world of gutturals."},{"id":"s0-91","sceneId":"s0","text":"It will undo him."},{"id":"s0-92","sceneId":"s0","text":"Infanta Marina"},{"id":"s0-93","sceneId":"s0","text":"Her terrace was the sand"},{"id":"s0-94","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the palms and the twilight."},{"id":"s0-95","sceneId":"s0","text":"She made of the motions of her wrist"}]}